# Placeholder. The cross-compiled mrsh aarch64-linux-android binary lands here
# as `libmrsh.so` during build (C3 — scripts/build-android-apk.sh).
#
# The lib*.so naming + jniLibs placement is what lets the APK installer extract
# the binary into the device's nativeLibraryDir with the execute bit set, which
# is the only path on Android Q+ that bypasses the W^X exec restriction inside
# /data/data/<pkg>/files (Permission denied otherwise).
